  <figure class="paper-landing-figure"><img src="/uploads/2024/12/Robot-Motion-Generation-Framework-1.png" alt="Taxonomy of implicit-model approaches: learning from demonstrations, reinforcement learning, cross-task learning, and large models, each with its sub-families."></figure>
